# Personal telemetry: conversation text, project names, branch names, cwd paths.
# Regenerate with `pnpm normalize`; NEVER commit.
#
# Ignore everything, rather than naming extensions. The previous version listed
# `*.parquet` and `manifest.json`, which left `index.json` and
# `replay/index.json` — session ids, sizes and timings — trackable. A denylist
# here has to stay right about every file the exporter will ever emit; this only
# has to be right once.
#
# This file was deleted once, when the directory was regenerated, and 122 files
# of personal telemetry were committed in its place. Nothing had been pushed, so
# the history was rewritten. Do not remove it again.
*
!.gitignore
